# Project Scope Statement

This document defines:

* Features included in the project
* Features excluded from the project
* Development boundaries
* Project delivery scope

The purpose of this document is to prevent scope creep during development.

---

# ✅ Included Scope

---

## 🌐 Website Development

Development of a responsive aesthetic medical beauty website, including:

* Homepage
* Treatment Listing Page
* Treatment Detail Page
* About Section
* Contact Section
* WhatsApp Integration

---

## 📅 Booking System

Customers are able to:

* Submit appointment bookings
* Select treatments
* Leave contact information
* Submit additional notes

---

## 💬 Customer Enquiry

Customers are able to:

* Submit enquiry forms
* Contact via WhatsApp
* Send general enquiries and consultation requests

---

## 💳 Payment Functionality

The system will support:

* FPX
* TNG eWallet
* Credit / Debit Card
* Bank Transfer

Used for:

* Deposit payment
* Basic payment workflow

---

## ⚙️ Admin Panel

Administrators are able to:

* Create / Edit / Delete treatments
* Upload treatment images
* Update pricing
* View bookings
* View enquiries

---

## 📱 Responsive Design

The website will support:

* Mobile devices
* Tablet devices
* Desktop devices

---

## 🎨 UI / UX Design

The website will follow:

* Premium aesthetic design
* Minimal UI approach
* Soft luxury medical beauty branding

---

# ❌ Excluded Scope

The following features are not included in the current project scope:

* Membership System
* Loyalty Point System
* Mobile Application
* AI Chatbot
* Multi-language System
* Advanced CRM System
* Inventory Management
* Staff Management
* Automated Marketing System
* Full E-commerce System

---

# ⚠️ Project Limitations

Due to project budget and project scale limitations:

* The project focuses on MVP (Minimum Viable Product)
* Brand presentation and booking functionality are the primary objectives
* Enterprise-level systems are not included
* Complex automation workflows are excluded

---

# 🚀 Future Expansion

Future versions may include:

* Membership Module
* Customer Account System
* CRM Automation
* Loyalty Rewards
* Analytics Dashboard
* AI Consultation Assistant
* Multi-branch Support

---

# 📦 Project Deliverables

Upon project completion, the following will be delivered:

* Responsive Website
* Frontend Source Code
* Backend API
* Database Structure
* Admin Dashboard
* Deployment Setup
* Basic Documentation
